    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 1.7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he losige, sie he afliemed ⁊ sie ámænsumod óf eallum Cristes ciricum.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he escapes, let him be banished and excommunicated from all churches of Christ.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If he succeeds in making his escape, he shall be banished, and excommunicated from all the churches of Christ.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he þonne losie, sy he aflymed ⁊ sy he amansumod of eallum Cristes ciricum.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
